    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/c79e81f1317ac4c3eab0b3a29b47f72a.poster.avif?t=1739457503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/c79e81f1317ac4c3eab0b3a29b47f72a.webm?t=1739457503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/c79e81f1317ac4c3eab0b3a29b47f72a.mp4?t=1739457503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A polished quick session Action Roguelite designed for immediate fun and replays</strong>.<br><br> Advance through stages, fight bosses, beat the game, repeat. Made it my ideal game: streamlined, quick to start, no interruptions.<br><br> Here's some more you'll like about it:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dual-purpose design</strong> for every action. Big fan of Downwell here.<br></li><li>Five stages, oddball enemies and bosses.<br></li><li><strong>Dope soundtrack</strong> from WangleLine, tenby.<br></li><li><strong>LOTS of upgrades</strong>, nobody likes repetitive runs.<br></li><li>Contains a <strong><i><u>Capybara</u></i></strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/b3df4947b6116751045bc101dc758d2f.poster.avif?t=1739457503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/b3df4947b6116751045bc101dc758d2f.webm?t=1739457503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/b3df4947b6116751045bc101dc758d2f.mp4?t=1739457503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/c79e81f1317ac4c3eab0b3a29b47f72a.poster.avif?t=1739457503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/c79e81f1317ac4c3eab0b3a29b47f72a.webm?t=1739457503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/c79e81f1317ac4c3eab0b3a29b47f72a.mp4?t=1739457503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A polished quick session Action Roguelite designed for immediate fun and replays</strong>.<br><br> Advance through stages, fight bosses, beat the game, repeat. Made it my ideal game: streamlined, quick to start, no interruptions.<br><br> Here's some more you'll like about it:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dual-purpose design</strong> for every action. Big fan of Downwell here.<br></li><li>Five stages, oddball enemies and bosses.<br></li><li><strong>Dope soundtrack</strong> from WangleLine, tenby.<br></li><li><strong>LOTS of upgrades</strong>, nobody likes repetitive runs.<br></li><li>Contains a <strong><i><u>Capybara</u></i></strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/b3df4947b6116751045bc101dc758d2f.poster.avif?t=1739457503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/b3df4947b6116751045bc101dc758d2f.webm?t=1739457503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354200/extras/b3df4947b6116751045bc101dc758d2f.mp4?t=1739457503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
